{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/netdata/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"NETDATA","content":"\n<p>In March 2022, I was invited to redesign Netdata&#8217;s WordPress website, which I rebuilt as a stylish Headless WordPress website in order to enhance performance and improve security, alongside a more modern approach to development using ReactJS and Netlify. I also removed a long list of plugins, bulky images and media content to create a much leaner and easier to manage CMS, whilst maintaining the same simple WordPress approach to editing content that the client understands. Needless to say that Netdata were overjoyed with the result!</p>\n","slug":"netdata","url":{"url":"https://www.netdata.cloud/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/1-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/1-768x577.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/2-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/2-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/2-768x577.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"}]}}},"image3":{"image3":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/3-300x225.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/3-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp